@api = http://localhost:5090/api

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Public site settings + theme (used by the Angular app at start-up)
GET {{api}}/site

### Sign in (seeded Super Admin; change the password on first login)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@queensinn.co.in", "password": "<Admin:DefaultPassword>" }

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Staff users
GET {{api}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Change theme
PUT {{api}}/admin/theme
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "primary": "#12352B", "accent": "#C2A46B", "surface": "#FAF9F5" }
